# LinkCode routing
#
# IMPORTANT — READ BEFORE DEPLOYING:
#   /unlock is served as a REAL FOLDER (unlock/index.html).
#   Do NOT add any redirect/rewrite rule for "/unlock" here OR in the
#   Netlify dashboard UI. A rewrite like "/unlock /Unlock.html 200" combined
#   with Netlify's automatic pretty-URL redirect (Unlock.html -> /unlock)
#   creates an infinite 301 loop (ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS).
#
#   Short codes (/123456) are handled by the Edge Function:
#   netlify/edge-functions/short-code.js  →  302 /unlock?code=123456
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
